  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil. Peel potato and cut into bite-sized chunks.\n• Cook in the boiling water until easily pierced with a knife, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan. Add the butter and milk to the potato and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a52011a55b36a89501f1fc/step-be9fa7b6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the potatoes are cooking, grate carrot. Drain and rinse butter beans.\n• In a medium bowl, combine panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients), a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a52011a55b36a89501f1fc/step-4cc3d850.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add sliced mushrooms and cook, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add plant-based mince and carrot and cook, breaking up with a spoon, 4-5 minutes. Add butter beans, garlic & herb seasoning and cook, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the water, passata, vegetable stock powder and cook until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a52011a55b36a89501f1fc/step-400da657.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the grill to high. Transfer the bean filling to a medium baking dish and spread potato mash over the top.\n• Sprinkle over shredded Cheddar cheese and the pangrattato. Grill until lightly golden, 5-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a52011a55b36a89501f1fc/step-9fba375b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the pie is grilling, thinly slice pear (see ingredients).\n• In a medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, pear, a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a52011a55b36a89501f1fc/step-a8996088.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the plant-based mince and mushroom potato top pie between plates.\n• Serve with the balsamic salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63a52011a55b36a89501f1fc/step-4714e0a0.jpg"
    }
  ]
